*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"

*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English

*Manufacturer: "Xerox"
*ModelName: "Xerox Pull Print"
*ShortNickName: "Xerox Pull Print"
*NickName: "Xerox Pull Print"
*PCFileName: "x3PULLP080.p3p"
*Product: "(Xerox WorkCentre)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.106) 1510"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*PrintPSErrors: True
*ADHasEuro: True
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*SuggestedJobTimeout: "0"
*SuggestedWaitTimeout: "120"
    

*LeadingEdge Short: ""
*DefaultLeadingEdge: Short
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*% Overridden by driver:
*Throughput: "25"

*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: CMYK

*FreeVM: "4340000"
*VMOption None/_Standard_: "4340000"
*FCacheSize None: "1079416"

*% === Custom Paper Sizes ===

*ParamCustomPageSize Width/_Width_: 1 points 72 7200 
*ParamCustomPageSize Height/_Height_: 2 points 72 7200
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 1 1
*MaxMediaWidth: "7200"
*MaxMediaHeight: "7200"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0

*NonUIOrderDependency: 46.5 AnySetup *CustomPageSize
*CustomPageSize True: "
 %Intentionally null
 pop pop pop pop pop"
*End

*% Paper definitions needed by certain PostScript passthrough applications that parse the .P3P file for capabilities.
*% The command invocations have been intentionally removed as required by this driver.

*% === Page Size ===
*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 47.0 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/Letter (8.5 x 11"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize Legal/Legal (8.5 x 14"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize Tabloid/Tabloid (11 x 17"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize Statement/Statement (5.5 x 8.5"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize Executive/Executive (7.25 x 10.5"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize FanFoldGermanLegal/8.5 x 13": "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize A4/A4 (210 x 297 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize A3/A3 (297 x 420 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize A5/A5 (148 x 210 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize JISB4/JIS B4 (257 x 364 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize JISB5/JIS B5 (182 x 257 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize EnvC5/C5 Envelope (162 x 229 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Monarch Envelope (3.9 x 7.5"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize Env10/No. 10 Envelope (4.1 x 9.5"): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*PageSize EnvDL/DL Envelope (110 x 220 mm): "%%Intentionally blank"
*End
*CloseUI: *PageSize

