*%
*% === Duplex ===
*%
*OpenUI *Duplex/_Duplex_: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50.0 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/_Simplex_: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/_Duplex_: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*Duplex DuplexTumble/_DuplexTumble_: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*%
*% === Resolution ===
*%
*OpenUI *Resolution/_Resolution_: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40.0 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600x600dpi 
*Resolution 200x200dpi/_200dpi_: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*Resolution 300x300dpi/_300dpi_: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*Resolution 400x200dpi/$400_x_200dpi$: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*Resolution 400x400dpi/_400dpi_: "
%Intentionally null"
*End
*Resolution 600x600dpi/_600dpi_: "
%Intentionally null" 
*End
*Resolution 600x1200dpi/_600_x_1200dpi_: "
%Intentionally null" 
*End
*Resolution 1200x600dpi/_1200_x_600dpi_: "
%Intentionally null" 
*End
*Resolution 1200x1200dpi/_1200dpi_: "
%Intentionally null" 
*End
*Resolution 1800x1800dpi/_1800dpi_: "
%Intentionally null" 
*End
*Resolution 2400x2400dpi/_2400dpi_: "
%Intentionally null" 
*End
*CloseUI: *Resolution

	
	

